  "pnpm": {
    "comment": "MIRRORS pnpm-workspace.yaml. Both are required: pnpm 9 (the Dockerfile + CI builder) reads ONLY this field and ignores pnpm-workspace.yaml; pnpm 10+ reads ONLY that file and warns this one is ignored. Declaring in one place alone makes the floors inert under the other major. scripts/ci/check-pnpm-overrides.mjs asserts the two stay identical.",
